  "notes": "Herdr fork preview (wwelder/herdr): agent titles survive a live update\n\nSource: 297aee1bfeed6e703cb59f92162550b027e92787 (wwelder/herdr#4).\n\n- A live handoff (`herdr update`) no longer blanks every pane's terminal title. Sidebar rows that show `terminal_title` / `terminal_title_stripped` stay filled, so they no longer go empty until each agent's next turn. Titles already blanked by an older handoff come back when this build imports them.\n\nThe Linux and Windows assets were built by the manual Build artifacts workflow. GitHub's macOS arm64 runners had no capacity, so both macOS assets were built on an Apple Silicon Mac from a clean checkout of the same commit with the workflow's settings (Rust 1.96.1, Zig 0.16.0, libghostty ReleaseSafe, SIMD off).\n\nUpdate with `herdr update` on the preview channel.",
